{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1145","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. Fourier Doodles"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In this problem you have to solve a simple classification task: given an image, determine whether it depicts a Fourier doodle. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given a set of 50 images with ids 1 through 50. You are also given a text file "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"labels.txt"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" containing the labels for images with ids 1 through 20, which comprise the learning data set. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You have to output the classification results for images with ids 21 through 50 in the same format."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"href":"http://tc-alchemy.progopedia.com/fourier-doodles.zip"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Download the images and the training labels"}],"kind":"link"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each line of the file "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"labels.txt"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" contains a single integer 0 or 1. Line $$$i$$$ (1-based) contains the label of the image "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"{i}.png"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". Label 1 means that the image depicts a Fourier doodle, label 0 - that it does not."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output 30 lines, one line per image 21 through 50. Line $$$i$$$ (1-based) should contain the classification result for the image "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"{i + 20}.png"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"E","problemCode":"1145E","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1145/problem/E"}